{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30868","headline":"赠祠部令狐郎中 · 马戴","name":"赠祠部令狐郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官初执宪称雄才，省转爲郎雅望催。\n待制松阴移玉殿，分宵露气静天台。\n算棋默向孤云坐，随鹤闲穷片水回。\n忽忆十年相识日，小儒新自海边来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}